(: One-line summary per fund (XPath 3.1: string concatenation operator ||). :)
/FundsXML4/Funds/Fund
    ! (Names/OfficialName || ' [' || Identifiers/ISIN || '] ' || Currency
       || ', NAV ' || format-number(number(
              FundDynamicData/TotalAssetValues/TotalAssetValue/TotalNetAssetValue/Amount),
              '#,##0'))
